# Preserve exact artifact bytes across clones because provenance and the
# submission manifest record SHA-256 hashes of the saved files.
# Unsetting text conversion leaves normal textual diffs available.
* -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
*.md whitespace=-blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
